{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0233","name":"王商","evidence":["wudi-q-o104"],"facts":[{"id":"wudi-f-b-317ba25623adcb5cd0ad-wudi-p0233-c55038","label":"字","text":"子威","evidence":["wudi-q-b-317ba25623adcb5cd0ad"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"子威","evidence":["wudi-q-b-317ba25623adcb5cd0ad"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o104-wudi-p0233","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o104"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-317ba25623adcb5cd0ad","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-317ba25623adcb5cd0ad","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗王商（？—前 12）：字子威，蠡吾（今河北高阳县西南）人。西汉成帝时任丞相，为人正直，受到王凤的排挤。而张匡一心迎合王凤，借出现日食上书朝廷，说王商“作威作福……执左道以乱政”。传见《汉书》卷八十二。左道：邪道。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":589,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b894f259d7071c70a139","start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o104","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8efba5dafb5dd32d0163","layer":"original","quote":"九月，令曰：“阿党比周〖4〗，先圣所疾也〖5〗。闻冀州俗：父子异部更相毁誉〖6〗。昔直不疑无兄，世人谓之盗嫂〖7〗；第五伯鱼三娶孤女，谓之挝妇翁〖8〗；王凤擅权，谷永比之申伯〖9〗；王商忠议，张匡谓之左道〖10〗。此皆以白为黑，欺天罔君者也〖11〗。吾欲整齐风俗；四者不除〖12〗，吾以为羞！”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":576,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
